{"full":"hf:build-small-hackathon/WitGym","spaceId":"build-small-hackathon/WitGym","name":"WitGym","source":"huggingface","description":"Paste awkward. Get one sharp wit line + coach drills.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","build-small-hackathon","track:wood","thousand-token-wood","comedy","rag","case-based-reasoning","qwen","achievement:offbrand","achievement:sharing","achievement:fieldnotes","sponsor:openai","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":3,"created":"2026-06-04T10:53:06.000Z","updated":"2026-06-15T22:16:38.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://build-small-hackathon-witgym.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/WitGym","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:29:36.569Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T20:29:36.569Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T20:29:36.569Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎭","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["One sharp line, grounded in human precedent — then drills to sharpen it.","WitGym is a comedy coaching engine for awkward real‑life moments. Paste what happened and it returns one usable line (not a paragraph), grounded in structurally similar precedent from The Office — then lets you iterate with drills: sharpen it, different angle, explain why it works.","Comedy has always been a personal interest — not just watching it, but reverse‑engineering why a line lands. Most “be funny” apps are vibes: you get a wall of text and no way to improve it."],"features":["Extract the mechanism (status games, tension, violation distance, subtext)","Retrieve precedent by structure (not by topic keywords)","Draft a few constrained options","Pick a winner with an explicit rubric","Polish to one sharp line"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/WitGym/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f007ed758d5c9ad77ab700ed970288ebc09665af3aa81171b051b4f45cb4c278","extractedAt":"